#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:661
msgid ""
"The shipping phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed after the shipping address section, and the "
"billing phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Kolom nomer telpon pengiriman bisa dipeksa dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot; yen "
"bagean alamat tagihan ditampilake sawise bagean alamat pengiriman, lan "
"kolom nomer telpon tagihan disetel dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot;. Iki "
"dibutuhake kanggo mesthekake yen alamat pengiriman bisa disalin menyang "
"alamat tagihan nalika opsi kasebut dicenthang, yen ora, pelanggan bisa uga "
"ora bisa ngrampungake formulir checkout."

#: inc/admin/admin-settings-checkout.php:687
msgid ""
"The billing phone field may be forced as \"required\" if the billing "
"address section is displayed before the shipping address section, and the "
"shipping phone field is set as \"required\". This is needed to ensure the "
"shipping address can be copied to the billing address when that option is "
"checked, otherwise the customer might not be able to complete the checkout "
"form."
msgstr ""
"Kolom nomer telpon tagihan bisa dipeksa dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot; yen "
"bagean alamat tagihan ditampilake sadurunge bagean alamat pengiriman, lan "
"kolom nomer telpon pengiriman disetel dadi &quot;dibutuhake&quot;. Iki "
"dibutuhake kanggo mesthekake alamat pengiriman bisa disalin menyang alamat "
"tagihan nalika opsi kasebut dicenthang, yen ora, pelanggan bisa uga ora "
"bisa ngrampungake formulir checkout."

