#: inc/admin/admin-notice-telemetry.php:127
msgid ""
"Usage tracking is optional and off by default. It helps us improve "
"compatibility and support. You can preview the exact data before it is "
"sent, and turn it off at any time."
msgstr ""
"Pelacakan panggunaan iku opsional lan dipateni kanthi gawan. Iki mbantu "
"kita ningkatake kompatibilitas lan dhukungan. Sampeyan bisa ndeleng "
"pratinjau data sing tepat sadurunge dikirim, lan mateni kapan wae."

#: inc/admin/admin-notice-telemetry.php:128
msgid ""
"When you turn it on, Fluid Checkout receives your site domain and basic "
"environment details: WordPress, PHP and WooCommerce versions, language, "
"store country, currency and timezone, your active theme, and your installed "
"plugins and their versions. You can also choose to include monthly order "
"counts and sales totals. No customer or user data is ever sent."
msgstr ""
"Nalika sampeyan nguripake, Fluid Checkout bakal nampa rincian domain situs "
"lan lingkungan dhasar sampeyan: versi WordPress, PHP lan WooCommerce, basa, "
"negara toko, mata uang lan zona wektu, tema aktif sampeyan, lan plugin sing "
"wis diinstal lan versine. Sampeyan uga bisa milih kanggo nyakup cacah "
"pesenan saben wulan lan total dodolan. Ora ana data pelanggan utawa "
"pangguna sing dikirim."

