"to allow downgrades to a pre-5.0 plugin version."
msgstr ""
"Wiwit Fluid Checkout 5.0, setelan disimpen ing profil. Baris pilihan "
"individu lawas isih bisa ana ing basis data saka versi lawas kanggo ngidini "
"downgrade menyang versi plugin sadurunge 5.0."

